============================================================
PREPROCESSING PIPELINE (CPAB Compatible)
============================================================
1. Load image as numpy array
2. Normalize: divide by 255.0 → range [0, 1]
3. Resize: skimage.transform.resize
   - output_shape=(224, 224)
   - mode='reflect'
   - anti_aliasing=True
4. Take first 3 channels [:, :, :3]
5. Convert to torch tensor (float32)
6. Permute: (H, W, C) → (C, H, W)
7. NO ImageNet normalization applied
